# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

reports/** linguist-documentation
reports/** linguist-generated
reports/** linguist-vendored
fuzz/corpus/** binary

# Measurement records keep the bytes the harness wrote them with.
#
# `* text=auto` above normalises line endings on the way in and restores the
# platform's on the way out, which is right for source and wrong for evidence: a
# record committed on Windows comes back with different bytes than it went in with,
# so a hash taken from the file and a hash taken from the blob disagree and nobody
# can tell which one a paper cited. It happened, on a campaign's four notes files,
# and only the fixed-width JSONL escaped because it had no bare newlines to convert.
#
# Provenance is by hash here, so the bytes are the artefact and must not be touched.
benchmark/results/** -text

